# TEMPLATE (WP-H12) — post the end-of-day line for the PREVIOUS COMPLETE DAY,
# just after the UTC boundary. Ruled 2026-08-04 (plink).
#
# Was 23:55 UTC reporting today-so-far, under a comment that read "23:55
# captures the full day". It did not. The last five minutes of every day landed
# in NO digest: stamped with today's date, but today's digest had already
# posted and tomorrow's reports tomorrow.
#
# Five minutes sounds like a rounding error and was not one — 12 of 103 audit
# events lived in that window, 34x over-represented, because the traffic there
# was not random. It was Claudette pulling her own audit 5-40 seconds after the
# digest posted, checking the number against her memory of what she did. The
# blind spot sat exactly over the resident auditing the ledger, so the ledger
# could not record that it had been checked.
#
# 00:05 rather than 00:00 so a slow rebuild cannot race the boundary it is
# reporting on.
[Unit]
Description=Post the Disjorn end-of-day #custodian action-count line (previous complete UTC day)

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 00:05:00 UTC
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
